/**
 * Rancho Santa Fe, CA — estate-belt pillar of the San Diego Wave-1 cluster.
 * Branch: San Diego — service_area (no public street address).
 *
 * Angle: INLAND estate country — deliberately differentiated from La Jolla
 * (no salt-air story here; dry heat, dust, longer condenser intervals) and
 * from Montecito/Hope Ranch prose (same species of market, fresh material:
 * Covenant framing, equestrian dust, manager-first workflow with gate access
 * and batched multi-appliance visits).
 *
 * Positioning per recon: $89 once; no factory-authorization implication;
 * NO technician names ("our San Diego technicians").
 * Zero-invention: Fire Magic / Perlick / Sub-Zero BI-series / cellar-unit
 * failure patterns limited to site-established material. No ReviewsBlock.
 */

