    "Billing follows the same logic — invoices to the management office or the family's bookkeeper, itemized the way accountants want them, with the property name on every line. If you manage several properties across our territory, one number covers all of them, from RSF to <a href=\"/la-jolla/\">La Jolla</a> and up the <a href=\"/carlsbad/\">Carlsbad</a> coast, with a consolidated paper trail.",
    "None of this is a premium tier. It's just how service has to work in a community where the caller, the payer, and the person who opens the gate are three different people."
  ]
};

